   "text": "SpacetimeDB holds the live, exact state. The Evidence Engine, built on Elastic, validates, organizes and ranks by meaning. The Decision Engine, Claude agents\nplus code, decides each insurance claim. Bright Data, Nessie and one Vultr server sit around them.",
