   "updated": 1792828800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The Decision Engine is the Claude agents in bandit-workers plus the code that decides coverage, amounts and learned rules. An incident becomes a claim with no form.\nThe venue's liability policy pays. Claude reads the bill and judges causation, but never sees or sets an amount: code prices every line and decides the route. The\norganizer's approval teaches a rule that settles the next similar claim by itself.",
   "originalText": "The Decision Engine is the Claude agents in bandit-workers plus the code that decides coverage, amounts and learned rules. An incident becomes a claim with no form.\nThe venue's liability policy pays. Claude reads the bill and judges causation, but never sees or sets an amount: code prices every line and decides the route. The\norganizer's approval teaches a rule that settles the next similar claim by itself.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
