   "versionNonce": 1083483449,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792828800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. A live fall becomes a claim. No rule exists yet, so it waits for the organizer in the host\nportal's Claims tab.\n2. A late note makes the first tap fail as stale; the organizer approves again. The payout lands in\nthe wallet and rule v1 is created with the organizer's name on it.\n3. Maya (band 91) falls the same way and settles in seconds under rule v1.\n4. A fake with witnesses in another zone is refused by code with every check listed.",
   "originalText": "1. A live fall becomes a claim. No rule exists yet, so it waits for the organizer in the host\nportal's Claims tab.\n2. A late note makes the first tap fail as stale; the organizer approves again. The payout lands in\nthe wallet and rule v1 is created with the organizer's name on it.\n3. Maya (band 91) falls the same way and settles in seconds under rule v1.\n4. A fake with witnesses in another zone is refused by code with every check listed.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
