   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792828800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every call asks for json_schema output.\nAn answer that breaks a rule is asked again once with the problems listed (ask_twice); the second call's kind is <kind>_retry.\nEvery call, with its tokens, latency and any error, is recorded in model_call.",
   "originalText": "Every call asks for json_schema output.\nAn answer that breaks a rule is asked again once with the problems listed (ask_twice); the second call's kind is <kind>_retry.\nEvery call, with its tokens, latency and any error, is recorded in model_call.",
