   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792828800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Each attendee gets a Nessie customer and checking account with $200. Merch purchases and claim payouts go through it. The Nessie sandbox records them but never moves\na balance, so the module keeps its own exact ledger, wallet_entry.",
